    <task id="Id_4a74bbb4-576e-430c-8f1c-3ce34024a219" name="6.3 Providenciar parecer jurídico">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 53. Ao final da fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria, o processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio seguir&amp;aacute; para o &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o de assessoramento jur&amp;iacute;dico daAdministra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, que realizar&amp;aacute; controle pr&amp;eacute;vio de legalidade mediante an&amp;aacute;lise jur&amp;iacute;dica da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 1&amp;ordm; Na elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do parecer jur&amp;iacute;dico, o &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o de assessoramento jur&amp;iacute;dico da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dever&amp;aacute;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - apreciar o processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio conforme crit&amp;eacute;rios objetivos pr&amp;eacute;vios de atribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de prioridade;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - redigir sua manifesta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o em linguagem simples e compreens&amp;iacute;vel e de forma clara e objetiva, com aprecia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;ode todos os elementos indispens&amp;aacute;veis &amp;agrave; contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e com exposi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos pressupostos de fato e de direito levadosem considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o na an&amp;aacute;lise jur&amp;iacute;dica;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 3&amp;ordm; Encerrada a instru&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do processo sob os aspectos t&amp;eacute;cnico e jur&amp;iacute;dico, a autoridade determinar&amp;aacute; adivulga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do edital de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o conforme disposto no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;art. 54&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 4&amp;ordm; Na forma deste artigo, o &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o de assessoramento jur&amp;iacute;dico da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o tamb&amp;eacute;m realizar&amp;aacute; controlepr&amp;eacute;vio de legalidade de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es diretas, acordos, termos de coopera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, conv&amp;ecirc;nios, ajustes, ades&amp;otilde;es a atas deregistro de pre&amp;ccedil;os, outros instrumentos cong&amp;ecirc;neres e de seus termos aditivos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 5&amp;ordm; &amp;Eacute; dispens&amp;aacute;vel a an&amp;aacute;lise jur&amp;iacute;dica nas hip&amp;oacute;teses previamente definidas em ato da autoridade jur&amp;iacute;dica m&amp;aacute;ximacompetente, que dever&amp;aacute; considerar o baixo valor, a baixa complexidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, a entrega imediata do bem oua utiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de minutas de editais e instrumentos de contrato, conv&amp;ecirc;nio ou outros ajustes previamente padronizadospelo &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o de assessoramento jur&amp;iacute;dico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_3bdbec44-2d82-47d5-a9d5-5cbd3008588e</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_5e25a3ff-4e28-4aac-a0a0-c838cbc569da</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_f7403e0e-8093-46ab-ad55-e9e09046bf8c">
        <dataOutput id="Id_e3ffc853-2cb4-40ef-bc32-407af16affe5">
          <documentation />
