    <task id="Id_4fc57ba4-7e75-4446-93d6-88d3773a678e" name="6.4 Divulgar o Edital">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 54. A publicidade do edital de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ser&amp;aacute; realizada mediante divulga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e manuten&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do inteiro teor doato convocat&amp;oacute;rio e de seus anexos no Portal Nacional de Contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es P&amp;uacute;blicas (PNCP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 1&amp;ordm; (VETADO).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 1&amp;ordm; Sem preju&amp;iacute;zo do disposto no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, &amp;eacute; obrigat&amp;oacute;ria a publica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de extrato do edital no Di&amp;aacute;rio Oficial daUni&amp;atilde;o, do Estado, do Distrito Federal ou do Munic&amp;iacute;pio, ou, no caso de cons&amp;oacute;rcio p&amp;uacute;blico, do ente de maior n&amp;iacute;vel entreeles, bem como em jornal di&amp;aacute;rio de grande circula&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;(Promulga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o partes vetadas)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 2&amp;ordm; &amp;Eacute; facultada a divulga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o adicional e a manuten&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do inteiro teor do edital e de seus anexos em s&amp;iacute;tioeletr&amp;ocirc;nico oficial do ente federativo do &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o ou entidade respons&amp;aacute;vel pela licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou, no caso de cons&amp;oacute;rcio p&amp;uacute;blico,do ente de maior n&amp;iacute;vel entre eles, admitida, ainda, a divulga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o direta a interessados devidamente cadastrados paraesse fim. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
